<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>House Inventory System - User Guide</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>How to View an Item</h1>
    <p>This section walks a user through viewing an existing item in the inventory.</p>

    <h2>Steps to View an Item</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Launch the application</li>
        <li>
            Locate the item you want to view in the inventory table.
            <img src="/view_item1.png"
                 alt="Find item to view"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>Select the item from the table, select 'View Item' button.</li>
        <li>
            The View Item window will open and display item information.
            <img src="/view_item2.png"
                 alt="View the item window"
                 style="width:500px; height: 300px; object-position:left; display:block;">
        </li>
        <li>Close the window when done, select 'Close' button.</li>
    </ol>
</body>
</html>